  "description": "The user is projected onto the implicit deictic of the meme's narrative, where the 'problem' (immigrants) is equated with the visual of people running (threat) and the 'solution' (death) is shown as 'problem fixed'. This frames the user as endorsing or identifying with the violent resolution, even without explicit deictic pronouns. The projection is onto the Scene entity 'immigrant_problem_scene' which encapsulates the entire hateful narrative.",
